c}}==\n{{Information\n|description={{en|1=3rd Maneuver Enhancement Brigade Shoulder Sleeve Insignia}}\n|date=2009-10-16\n|source=http://www.tioh.hqda.pentagon.mil/Catalog/ViewImage.aspx?id=3976\n|author=The Institute of Heraldry (TIOH)\n|permission=\n|other versions=\n}}\n\n=={{int:license-header}}==\n{{PD-USGov}}\n\n[[Category:US Army Maneuver Enhancement Brigade Shoulder Sleeve Insignia]]\n[[Category:Combat service identification badges of the United States Army]]"}}}]},{"pageid":120422100,"ns":6,"title":"File:United States Army Training Center Badge.jpg","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"timestamp":"2022-07-14T04:25:45Z","user":"Coldstreamer20","size":12444,"width":233,"height":327,"thumburl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/United_States_Army_Training_Center_Badge.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","thumbwidth":342,"thumbheight":480,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/United_States_Army_Training_Center_Badge.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":342,"height":480},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/a/ab/United_States_Army_Training_Center_Badge.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:United_States_Army_Training_Center_Badge.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=120422100","sha1":"63571ca411894f22c582db0e1a1d0991f1bd9a2f","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2022-07-14 04:25:45","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"United States Army Training Center Badge","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Shoulder Sleeve Insignia of the United States Army (SSI)|PD US Army USAIOH|2007 in heraldry|US Army School Shoulder Sleeve Insignia","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Badge of the United States Army Training Center.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"2007-02-07","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://tioh.army.mil/Catalog/HeraldryMulti.aspx?CategoryId=2990&amp;grp=2&amp;menu=Uniformed%20Services\">U.S. Army Training Center and Fort Jackson heraldry</a> from the U.S. Institute of Heraldry website","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<bdi><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:United_States_Army\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:United States Army\"><span title=\"land service branch of the United States Armed Forces\">United States Army</span></a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}},"mime":"image/jpeg"}],"revisions":[{"revid":1139763602,"parentid":1025575107,"timestamp":"2025-12-31T20:51:53Z","slots":{"main":{"contentmodel":"wikitext","contentformat":"text/x-wiki","content":"=={{int:filedesc}}==\n{{Information\n| description    = {{en|1=Badge of the United States Army Training Center.}}\n| date           = 2007-02-07\n| source         = [https://tioh.army.mil/Catalog/HeraldryMulti.aspx?CategoryId=2990&grp=2&menu=Uniformed%20Services U.S. Army Training Center and Fort Jackson heraldry] from the U.S. Institute of Heraldry website\n| author         = {{Creator:United States Army}}\n| permission     = \n| other versions = \n}}\n\n== {{int:filedesc}} ==\n'''Blazon'''\n\n''On a light blue lozenge-shaped embroidered device with rounded corners, a yellow reversed chevron surmounted by a black torch with red outer flame and yellow inner flame, surmounted by two diagonally crossed black rifles, all within a 1/8 inch (.32 cm) black border. Overall dimensions are 2 1/8 inches (5.40 cm) in width by 3 inches (7.62 cm) in length''.\n\n'''Symbolism'''\n\nThe reversed chevron denotes a \"V\" signifying \"Victory,\" which alludes to Fort Jackson's historical motto \"Victory Starts Here.\" The torch symbolizes knowledge and the military training gained during the transformation from civilian to soldier. Black denotes constancy. The crossed rifles signify teamwork. The Infantry blue and rifles represent the principles of ground combat, which provide the foundation for training warriors and developing military skills.\n\n'''Background'''\n\nThe shoulder sleeve insignia was approved on 20 February 2007. (TIOH Drawing Number A-1-915)\n\n=={{int:license-header}}==\n\n{{PD-USGov-Military-Army-USAIOH}}\n\n[[Category:Shoulder Sleeve Insignia of the United States Army (SSI)]]\n[[Category:US Army School Shoulder Sleeve Insignia]]\n[[Category:2007 in heraldry]]"}}}]},{"pageid":163439279,"ns":6,"title":"File:49th Quartermaster Group SSI.jpg","imagerepository":"local","imageinfo":[{"timestamp":"2025-04-11T17:59:44Z","user":"Coldstreamer20","size":9568,"width":184,"height":276,"thumburl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/49th_Quartermaster_Group_SSI.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","thumbwidth":320,"thumbheight":480,"thumbattribs":{"src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/49th_Quartermaster_Group_SSI.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","decoding":"async","loading":"lazy","width":320,"height":480},"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/2e/49th_Quartermaster_Group_SSI.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","descriptionurl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:49th_Quartermaster_Group_SSI.jpg","descriptionshorturl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/w/index.php?curid=163439279","sha1":"372d4e382e1b76019a345f9ea387c3a8e09a58c4","extmetadata":{"DateTime":{"value":"2025-04-11 17:59:44","source":"mediawiki-metadata","hidden":""},"ObjectName":{"value":"49th Quartermaster Group SSI","source":"mediawiki-metadata"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"PD US Army USAIOH|US Army Group Shoulder Sleeve Insignia","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"ImageDescription":{"value":"Shoulder Sleeve Insignia (SSI) of the 49th Quartermaster Group, part of the United States Army.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"1998-06-22","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://tioh.army.mil/Catalog/Heraldry.aspx?HeraldryId=7263&amp;CategoryId=4073&amp;grp=2&amp;menu=Uniformed%20Services&amp;ps=24&amp;p=0\">The Institute of Heraldry website</a>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Artist":{"value":"<bdi><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:United_States_Army\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:United States Army\"><span title=\"land service branch of the United States Armed Forces\">United States Army</span></a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-template